## Complete Example: Bug-Fixing Agent

Putting it all together:

```python
import asyncio
from claude_agent_sdk import query, ClaudeAgentOptions, AssistantMessage, ResultMessage, TextBlock

async def main():
    print("Bug-Fixing Agent Starting...\n")

    options = ClaudeAgentOptions(
        allowed_tools=["Read", "Edit", "Glob", "Bash", "Grep"],
        permission_mode="acceptEdits",
        system_prompt="You are an expert Python developer.",
        max_turns=10
    )

    async for message in query(
        prompt="Find and fix all bugs in utils.py",
        options=options
    ):
        if isinstance(message, AssistantMessage):
            for block in message.content:
                if isinstance(block, TextBlock):
                    print(f"Claude: {block.text}\n")

        elif isinstance(message, ResultMessage):
            if message.subtype == 'success':
                print(f"Done! Cost: ${message.total_cost_usd}")

asyncio.run(main())
```

