## Quick Reference: Common Options

| Option | Type | What It Does |
|--------|------|--------------|
| `allowed_tools` | list | Which tools agent can use |
| `permission_mode` | string | How permissions work |
| `system_prompt` | string | Custom instructions |
| `max_turns` | int | Limit conversation length |
| `resume` | string | Session ID to continue |
| `cwd` | string | Working directory |
| `model` | string | Which Claude model to use |

