## Troubleshooting

| Problem | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| `CLINotFoundError` | Install Claude Code first |
| Agent can't find files | Check `cwd` option points to right directory |
| Permission denied | Use `permission_mode="acceptEdits"` |
| Agent runs too long | Set `max_turns` to limit iterations |
| Need to stop agent | Use `client.interrupt()` with ClaudeSDKClient |

